{"id":"u02","kelas":7,"no":2,"judul":"Keluarga dan Teman","title":"My Family and Friends","emoji":"👨‍👩‍👧","ringkas":"Anggota keluarga, kata ganti, dan to be (am/is/are)","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut anggota keluarga: [[father]], [[mother]], [[brother]], [[sister]], dan lainnya","memakai kata ganti: [[I]], [[you]], [[he]], [[she]], [[it]], [[we]], [[they]]","memakai **to be**: [[am]], [[is]], [[are]] dalam kalimat positif, negatif, dan pertanyaan","menunjukkan kepemilikan: [[my]], [[your]], [[his]], [[her]], [[our]], [[their]]","memperkenalkan keluarga dan temanmu dalam bahasa Inggris"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di **Unit 2** kamu belajar bercerita tentang **keluarga dan teman**. Kamu juga mengenal tiga kata kecil yang sangat penting dalam bahasa Inggris: [[am]], [[is]], dan [[are]]. Siap? Ayo mulai!"},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Anggota keluarga (Family members)","items":[{"en":"father","id":"ayah (bisa juga: dad)","ex":"My father is a teacher."},{"en":"mother","id":"ibu (bisa juga: mom)","ex":"My mother is a nurse."},{"en":"parents","id":"orang tua (ayah dan ibu)","ex":"My parents are kind."},{"en":"brother","id":"saudara laki-laki","ex":"I have one brother."},{"en":"sister","id":"saudara perempuan","ex":"My sister is eight."},{"en":"grandfather","id":"kakek (bisa juga: grandpa)","ex":"My grandfather is old."},{"en":"grandmother","id":"nenek (bisa juga: grandma)","ex":"My grandmother is kind."},{"en":"grandparents","id":"kakek dan nenek","ex":"My grandparents are old."},{"en":"uncle","id":"paman / om","ex":"My uncle is a driver."},{"en":"aunt","id":"bibi / tante","ex":"My aunt is a doctor."},{"en":"cousin","id":"sepupu","ex":"My cousin is twelve."},{"en":"son","id":"anak laki-laki","ex":"He is her son."},{"en":"daughter","id":"anak perempuan","ex":"She is his daughter."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Teman (Friends)","items":[{"en":"friend","id":"teman","ex":"Budi is my friend."},{"en":"best friend","id":"sahabat","ex":"Rani is my best friend."},{"en":"classmate","id":"teman sekelas","ex":"Dina is my classmate."},{"en":"neighbor","id":"tetangga","ex":"Mr. Adi is my neighbor."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Kakak atau adik?","text":"Dalam bahasa Inggris, **brother** dan **sister** tidak membedakan kakak atau adik. Kalau perlu, tambahkan [[older brother]] (kakak laki-laki) atau [[younger sister]] (adik perempuan)."},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Kata ganti orang (Subject pronouns)","text":"Kata ganti dipakai supaya kita tidak mengulang nama terus-menerus. Contoh: *Rani is my sister. **She** is eight.*","table":[["Kata ganti","Artinya","Dipakai untuk"],["[[I]]","aku / saya","diri sendiri"],["[[You]]","kamu / kalian","lawan bicara"],["[[He]]","dia (laki-laki)","satu laki-laki"],["[[She]]","dia (perempuan)","satu perempuan"],["[[It]]","itu","benda atau hewan"],["[[We]]","kami / kita","aku + orang lain"],["[[They]]","mereka","lebih dari satu orang atau benda"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. To be: am, is, are","text":"Dalam bahasa Inggris, hampir setiap kalimat butuh kata kerja. Untuk menyatakan \"adalah / ada dalam keadaan\", kita pakai **to be**. Bentuknya berubah mengikuti kata ganti:","table":[["Kata ganti","To be","Contoh","Singkatan"],["I","**am**","[[I am a student.]]","I'm"],["You, we, they","**are**","[[You are my friend.]]","you're, we're, they're"],["He, she, it","**is**","[[She is my sister.]]","he's, she's, it's"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[My father is a teacher.]]","id":"Ayahku (= he) pakai is."},{"en":"[[My parents are kind.]]","id":"Orang tuaku (= they) pakai are."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Satu atau banyak?","text":"Jika subjeknya **satu** orang/benda, pakai **is**. Jika **banyak** (parents, friends, brothers), pakai **are**."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Kalimat negatif dan pertanyaan","text":"**Negatif:** tambahkan **not** setelah am/is/are. **Pertanyaan:** pindahkan am/is/are ke depan kalimat.","table":[["Positif","Negatif","Pertanyaan"],["He is my brother.","He is **not** (isn't) my brother.","**Is** he your brother?"],["They are my cousins.","They are **not** (aren't) my cousins.","**Are** they your cousins?"],["I am tired.","I am **not** tired.","**Am** I late?"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[Are you Budi's brother?]] — [[Yes, I am.]]","id":"Apakah kamu kakak/adiknya Budi? — Ya, benar."},{"en":"[[Is she your mother?]] — [[No, she isn't. She is my aunt.]]","id":"Apakah dia ibumu? — Bukan. Dia bibiku."}]},{"t":"warn","title":"Jangan lupa to be","text":"Dalam bahasa Indonesia kita bilang \"Dia guru\". Dalam bahasa Inggris tidak boleh tanpa to be: **She is a teacher.** Bukan *She a teacher*."},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Kepemilikan: my, your, his, her, our, their","text":"Untuk menyatakan \"milik siapa\", kata gantinya berubah:","table":[["Kata ganti","Kepemilikan","Contoh"],["I","**my**","[[my father]] (ayahku)"],["you","**your**","[[your mother]] (ibumu)"],["he","**his**","[[his sister]] (adik/kakak perempuannya)"],["she","**her**","[[her brother]] (saudara laki-lakinya)"],["we","**our**","[[our teacher]] (guru kami)"],["they","**their**","[[their house]] (rumah mereka)"]],"examples":[{"en":"Rani's mother → [[Rani's mother is a nurse.]]","id":"Tambahkan 's untuk menunjukkan milik seseorang."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Foto keluarga","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Who is that woman?","id":"Siapa perempuan itu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"She is my mother. Her name is Ani.","id":"Dia ibuku. Namanya Ani."},{"who":"Tom","en":"And who is the boy?","id":"Dan siapa anak laki-laki itu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"He is my brother. His name is Raka. He is eight years old.","id":"Dia adikku. Namanya Raka. Umurnya delapan tahun."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Are they your parents?","id":"Apakah mereka orang tuamu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes, they are. My father is a teacher.","id":"Ya, benar. Ayahku seorang guru."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Memperkenalkan sahabat","lines":[{"who":"Budi","en":"Mom, this is my best friend, Rani.","id":"Bu, ini sahabatku, Rani."},{"who":"Mother","en":"Hello, Rani. Nice to meet you.","id":"Halo, Rani. Senang bertemu denganmu."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Nice to meet you, too. Budi and I are classmates.","id":"Senang bertemu denganmu juga. Budi dan aku teman sekelas."},{"who":"Mother","en":"Are you hungry? Please come in.","id":"Apakah kamu lapar? Silakan masuk."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Keluarga: [[father]], [[mother]], [[brother]], [[sister]], [[grandfather]], [[grandmother]], [[uncle]], [[aunt]], [[cousin]].","To be: **I am**, **you/we/they are**, **he/she/it is**.","Negatif: tambah **not**. Pertanyaan: pindahkan am/is/are ke depan.","Kepemilikan: **my, your, his, her, our, their**.","Satu orang pakai **is**, banyak orang pakai **are**."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan anggota keluarga dengan artinya:","pairs":[["father","ayah"],["sister","saudara perempuan"],["grandmother","nenek"],["uncle","paman"],["cousin","sepupu"]],"exp":"Kosakata keluarga sangat sering dipakai saat bercerita."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Rani adalah anak perempuan dari ibuku. Dalam bahasa Inggris, Rani adalah ___ ibuku.","options":["son","daughter","uncle","cousin"],"answer":1,"exp":"Anak perempuan = daughter. Anak laki-laki = son."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ayah dan ibumu bersama-sama disebut...","options":["cousins","neighbors","parents","classmates"],"answer":2,"exp":"Parents = orang tua (ayah dan ibu)."},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia (perempuan) adalah ibuku.","q":"She ___ my mother.","answers":["is"],"hint":"she → ...","exp":"Untuk he, she, it kita memakai is."},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka adalah sepupuku.","q":"They ___ my cousins.","answers":["are"],"hint":"they → ...","exp":"Untuk you, we, they kita memakai are."},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku seorang siswa.","q":"I ___ a student.","answers":["am"],"hint":"I → ...","exp":"Hanya I yang memakai am."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["My brother are tall.","My brother is tall.","My brother am tall.","My brother tall."],"answer":1,"exp":"My brother = satu orang (= he), jadi pakai is."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["My parents is kind.","My parents am kind.","My parents are kind.","My parents be kind."],"answer":2,"exp":"Parents = lebih dari satu (= they), jadi pakai are."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia (perempuan) bukan kakakku.\"","answer":"She is not my sister.","exp":"Negatif to be: subjek + is + not + ..."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah mereka temanmu?\"","answer":"Are they your friends?","exp":"Pertanyaan: Are/Is dipindah ke depan."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban singkat yang benar untuk \"Is he your brother?\" (ya) adalah...","options":["Yes, he is.","Yes, he are.","Yes, I am.","Yes, it is."],"answer":0,"exp":"Ditanya Is he ...? → jawab Yes, he is."},{"type":"fill","id":"Namanya Rani. (dia perempuan)","q":"___ name is Rani.","answers":["her"],"hint":"she → his / her?","exp":"Milik perempuan = her. Milik laki-laki = his."},{"type":"fill","id":"Ayahnya bernama Adi. (dia laki-laki)","q":"___ father is Adi.","answers":["his"],"hint":"he → his / her?","exp":"Milik laki-laki = his."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan, lalu pilih artinya.","say":"She is my best friend","options":["Dia sahabatku","Dia ibuku","Dia guruku","Dia tetanggaku"],"answer":0,"exp":"best friend = sahabat."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pertanyaannya?","say":"Are they your parents","options":["Apakah mereka orang tuamu?","Apakah kamu orang tuanya?","Siapa orang tuamu?","Di mana orang tuamu?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Are they your parents? = Apakah mereka orang tuamu?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata ganti yang tepat: \"Rani and I are classmates. ___ are in Class 7A.\"","options":["They","We","She","You"],"answer":1,"exp":"Rani and I = aku + orang lain = we."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata ganti dengan kepemilikannya:","pairs":[["I","my"],["you","your"],["he","his"],["she","her"],["they","their"]],"exp":"I → my, you → your, he → his, she → her, they → their."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan anggota keluarga dengan artinya:","pairs":[["brother","saudara laki-laki"],["aunt","bibi"],["son","anak laki-laki"],["daughter","anak perempuan"],["grandfather","kakek"]],"exp":"Kosakata keluarga."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["My mother is a nurse.","My mother am a nurse.","My mother are a nurse.","My mother a nurse."],"answer":0,"exp":"My mother = she → is."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["We are friends.","We is friends.","We am friends.","We be friends."],"answer":0,"exp":"We → are."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["It is a cat.","It are a cat.","It am a cat.","It a cat."],"answer":0,"exp":"It → is."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat negatif yang benar.","options":["She isn't my sister.","She not my sister.","She aren't my sister.","She doesn't my sister."],"answer":0,"exp":"is + not = isn't."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["Are you a student?","You are a student?","Do you are a student?","Is you a student?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Are + you + ...?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu menunjuk saudara laki-lakimu dan berkata...","options":["This is my brother.","This is brother my.","This are my brother.","This my is brother."],"answer":0,"exp":"This is + my + brother."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami adalah siswa.","q":"We ___ students.","answers":["are"],"hint":"we → ...","exp":"We + are."},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia (laki-laki) adalah kakakku.","q":"He ___ my brother.","answers":["is"],"hint":"he → ...","exp":"He + is."},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini rumah kami.","q":"This is ___ house. (we)","answers":["our"],"hint":"we → my / our ?","exp":"we → our."},{"type":"fill","id":"Itu buku mereka.","q":"That is ___ book. (they)","answers":["their"],"hint":"they → ...","exp":"they → their."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia bukan sepupuku.\"","answer":"He is not my cousin.","exp":"Subjek + is + not + ..."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Apakah dia gurumu?\"","answer":"Is she your teacher?","exp":"Is + she + your teacher?"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Orang tuaku sangat baik.\"","answer":"My parents are very kind.","exp":"My parents + are + very + adjective."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa dia?","say":"He is my uncle","options":["Dia pamanku","Dia kakekku","Dia kakakku","Dia sepupuku"],"answer":0,"exp":"uncle = paman."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"They are my grandparents","options":["Mereka kakek dan nenekku","Mereka orang tuaku","Mereka sepupuku","Mereka temanku"],"answer":0,"exp":"grandparents = kakek dan nenek."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Pilih kalimat yang kamu dengar.","say":"She is not my sister","options":["She is not my sister.","She is my sister.","He is not my brother.","They are not my sisters."],"answer":0,"exp":"Dengarkan kata not."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"This is my family. My father is a teacher. My mother is a nurse. I have one sister. Her name is Dewi.\" Apa pekerjaan ibu?","options":["Perawat","Guru","Dokter","Pedagang"],"answer":0,"exp":"My mother is a nurse."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"This is my family. My father is a teacher. My mother is a nurse. I have one sister. Her name is Dewi.\" Siapa Dewi?","options":["Saudara perempuan penulis","Ibu penulis","Bibi penulis","Teman penulis"],"answer":0,"exp":"I have one sister. Her name is Dewi."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Budi is my best friend. He is twelve. He is tall and funny. We are classmates.\" Apa hubungan penulis dan Budi?","options":["Sahabat dan teman sekelas","Saudara kandung","Sepupu","Tetangga"],"answer":0,"exp":"best friend; classmates."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Who is that man?\" B: \"___ is my uncle.\" Kata yang tepat adalah...","options":["He","She","They","We"],"answer":0,"exp":"Man (laki-laki) → he."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"Is she your sister?\" B: \"No, ___. She is my cousin.\"","options":["she isn't","she aren't","I'm not","he isn't"],"answer":0,"exp":"Is she ...? → No, she isn't."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["They is my parents.","They are my parents.","My parents are kind.","My parents are teachers."],"answer":0,"exp":"They → are."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["Her name is Budi. (Budi laki-laki)","His name is Budi.","Her name is Dewi.","His name is Raka."],"answer":0,"exp":"Budi laki-laki → his."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I are a student.","I am a student.","You are a student.","She is a student."],"answer":0,"exp":"I → am."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Mereka adalah orang tuaku\" adalah...","options":["They are my parents.","They is my parent.","They are I parents.","They are me parents."],"answer":0,"exp":"They are my parents."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Dia (perempuan) bukan ibuku\" adalah...","options":["She isn't my mother.","She not my mother.","She doesn't my mother.","She aren't my mother."],"answer":0,"exp":"She isn't."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["classmate","father","mother","brother"],"answer":0,"exp":"classmate bukan anggota keluarga."},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia adalah gurunya. (dia laki-laki)","q":"He ___ his teacher.","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"He → is."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kakek dan nenekku sangat baik.","q":"My ___ are very kind. (kakek dan nenek)","answers":["grandparents"],"hint":"g _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"grandparents."},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini adalah ayahku. Namanya Adi.","q":"This is my father. ___ name is Adi.","answers":["his"],"hint":"his / her ?","exp":"Ayah laki-laki → his."},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka adalah teman sekelasku.","q":"They are my ___.","answers":["classmates"],"hint":"c _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"classmates."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Ini adalah sahabatku.\"","answer":"This is my best friend.","exp":"This is + my + best friend."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia (laki-laki) bukan kakakku.\"","answer":"He isn't my brother.","exp":"He + isn't + my brother."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Siapa dia?","say":"She is my aunt","options":["Bibiku","Ibuku","Nenekku","Sepupuku"],"answer":0,"exp":"aunt = bibi."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pertanyaannya?","say":"Are they your friends","options":["Apakah mereka temanmu?","Apakah dia temanmu?","Siapa temanmu?","Di mana temanmu?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Are they ...?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu menunjukkan foto keluargamu. Apa yang kamu katakan tentang ibumu?","options":["This is my mother. She is a nurse.","This is my mother. He is a nurse.","This are my mother. She is a nurse.","This is mother me. She nurse."],"answer":0,"exp":"This is + my mother."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Seseorang bertanya, \"Is he your brother?\" Dia sepupumu. Jawabanmu?","options":["No, he isn't. He is my cousin.","Yes, he is. He is my cousin.","No, he aren't. He is my cousin.","No, I am not."],"answer":0,"exp":"No, he isn't."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["grandmother","grandmoter","granmother","grandmothar"],"answer":0,"exp":"grandmother."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["daughter","dauter","doughter","daugther"],"answer":0,"exp":"daughter."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["neighbor","nighbor","neibor","neighbur"],"answer":0,"exp":"neighbor."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is that woman?\" (Dia ibuku.)","options":["Who","What","Where","When"],"answer":0,"exp":"Who = siapa."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is your father's job?\" (Dia guru.)","options":["What","Who","Where","When"],"answer":0,"exp":"What = apa."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is your best friend?\" (Dia Rani.)","options":["Who","What","How","When"],"answer":0,"exp":"Who."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata ganti yang tepat: \"Rani and Dina are my friends. ___ are kind.\"","options":["They","She","We","It"],"answer":0,"exp":"They."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata ganti yang 